   ],
   "spoken": "The formula against a troll opening: develop your pieces, blast open the centre, then go for mate. Don't lunge with Qh5-check or Bc4-check — they run into g6 and e6. Start with the most flexible developing move, Nc3.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Punish an offbeat opening by developing first; premature checks just hand the opponent the moves he wanted."
  },
  {
